### VAE Architecture Module

#### [NEW] [vae_model.py](file:///c:/VIT_CHENNAI/Computer_science/Machine%20Learning/Projects/LatentSched/vae_model.py)
- `TraceVAE(nn.Module)`: Bidirectional LSTM encoder, LSTM decoder
  - `encode(x) → (mu, log_var)`
  - `reparameterize(mu, log_var) → z`
  - `decode(z, seq_len) → x_recon`
  - `forward(x) → (x_recon, mu, log_var)`
- `vae_loss(recon_x, x, mu, log_var, beta)`: Combined reconstruction + KL loss

